{"id":"n15979-2-9","stage":2,"title":"감독 · 教练","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15979-2-9-1","ko":"두 영화가 분위기가 비슷하네.","zh":"这两部电影的氛围真相似啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"영화가","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화가","audio":"/audio/71d36dbc5cb7f78071bd.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷하네.","meaning":"类似，相似，相近","explanation":"비슷하다：类似，相似，相近；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"1","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷하네","audio":"/audio/0a2be418cfbbbdaed3da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"在某个场合或场面获得的感受。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"9903f9b7bf915b82","term":"비슷하다","zh":"类似，相似，相近","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3","entryId":"65864","definition":"两种或两种以上的大小、模样、状态及性质等虽不完全相同，但有很多相像之处。","pronunciation":["비스타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b71559ade46d38c070b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15979-2-9-2","ko":"같은 감독이 만든 영화라서 그런가 봐.","zh":"大概是同一个导演执导的缘故吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"같은","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"감독이","meaning":"导演（电影）","explanation":"감독：导演（电影）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감독","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15979","senseId":"2","lemma":"감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감독이","audio":"/audio/e1b5da318d479cc64998.mp3"}},{"text":"만든","meaning":"制作","explanation":"만들다：制作；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"11","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만든","audio":"/audio/ff3d22622fd1cccc3625.mp3"}},{"text":"영화라서","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화라서","audio":"/audio/b37979364f097eb33052.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런가","audio":"/audio/1871cee48506a0d12f8c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相同，一样，一致","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"彼此并无差异。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"7fcf6259bbb0a418","term":"감독","zh":"导演（电影）","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3","entryId":"15979","definition":"导演（电影）","pronunciation":["감독"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"新完成电影或戏剧等并上演。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9113d232e78fa98c51d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.398,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15979","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9501,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大概是同一个导演执导的缘故吧。","这两部电影的氛围真相似啊。","宝宝太可爱了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这两部电影的氛围真相似啊。","宝宝太可爱了。","大概是同一个导演执导的缘故吧。"],"answer":2}]}
